type ReplayManifest = {
  batch_id: string;
  input_hashes: string[];
  seeds: string[];
  model_version: string;
  timestamp: string;
  signature: string;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you test nondeterministic components (e.g., GPU ops) for replay fidelity?
- How would you scale replay verification across thousands of batches?
